    "description": {
      "value": "The appearance of this beautifully crafted +2 disrupting greater striking lance changes to match the armor of its wielder. It has a cloth flag attached behind the lance point that displays whatever heraldry the wielder wishes.\n\nIf a cavalier with the Cavalier's Banner feat takes the knight captain's lance, it instead automatically displays the banner of their pledge.\n\nActivate (Reaction)\nTrigger: Your attack roll with the knight captain's lance is a critical success\nYou raise the lance, inspiring those around you. Allies within 30 feet that can see you receive a +1 status bonus to their attack rolls and damage rolls for 1 round."
